sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant WP as WordlePage<br/>(_WordlePageState)
    participant LD as LyingDownDetector
    participant GS as GyroscopeEventStream<br/>(sensors_plus)
    participant LO as LyingDownOverlay

    Note over WP, LO: === INITIALIZATION ===
    WP->>WP: initState()
    WP->>LD: new LyingDownDetector(onLyingDownChanged, onOrientationChanged)
    WP->>LD: startListening()
    LD->>LD: _pitch=0, _roll=0, _yaw=0, _lastTimestamp=null
    LD->>GS: gyroscopeEventStream(samplingPeriod: 50ms).listen(_onGyroscopeEvent)
    GS-->>LD: StreamSubscription

    Note over WP, LO: === GYROSCOPE EVENT LOOP ===
    loop Every 50ms (while listening)
        GS->>LD: GyroscopeEvent(x, y, z)
        LD->>LD: _onGyroscopeEvent(event)
        LD->>LD: now = DateTime.now()
        alt _lastTimestamp != null
            LD->>LD: dt = (now - _lastTimestamp) / 1_000_000
            LD->>LD: _pitch += event.x * dt
            LD->>LD: _roll += event.y * dt
            LD->>LD: _yaw += event.z * dt
            LD->>LD: Normalize angles to [-π, π]
            LD->>LD: angularSpeed = sqrt(x² + y² + z²)
            alt angularSpeed > 10.0 rad/s
                LD->>LD: Reset _pitch=0, _roll=0, _yaw=0 (drift correction)
            end
        end
        LD->>LD: _lastTimestamp = now
        
        Note over LD: Orientation callback (for UI if needed)
        LD-->>WP: onOrientationChanged(_pitch, _roll, _yaw)
        
        Note over LD: Lying down detection
        LD->>LD: currentlyLyingDown = |pitch|>1.3 OR |roll|>1.3
        LD->>LD: _debounceStateChange(currentlyLyingDown)
        
        alt State change detected & not already debouncing
            LD->>LD: Cancel existing _debounceTimer
            LD->>LD: _debounceTarget = currentlyLyingDown
            LD->>LD: Timer(2 seconds) → _debounceTimer
            Note over LD: Wait 2s for stable state...
        end
    end

    Note over WP, LO: === DEBOUNCE COMPLETION ===
    LD->>LD: Timer fires after 2s
    LD->>LD: _isLyingDown = currentlyLyingDown
    LD->>LD: _debounceTarget = null
    LD-->>WP: onLyingDownChanged(_isLyingDown)

    Note over WP, LO: === UI REACTION ===
    WP->>WP: setState(() => _isLyingDown = lyingDown)
    WP->>WP: build()
    
    alt _isLyingDown == true
        WP->>LO: LyingDownOverlay(onDismiss: resetOrientation)
        LO->>User: Show overlay: "Mohon duduk untuk main game ini"
        LO->>User: Button: "Aku sudah duduk"
    end

    Note over WP, LO: === USER DISMISSES OVERLAY ===
    User->>LO: Tap "Aku sudah duduk"
    LO->>WP: onDismiss()
    WP->>LD: resetOrientation()
    LD->>LD: _pitch=0, _roll=0, _yaw=0, _lastTimestamp=null
    LD->>LD: Cancel _debounceTimer
    LD->>LD: _debounceTarget = null
    LD-->>WP: onOrientationChanged(0, 0, 0)
    WP->>WP: setState() → rebuild
    LO->>User: Overlay disappears

    Note over WP, LO: === CLEANUP ===
    WP->>WP: dispose()
    WP->>LD: dispose()
    LD->>LD: stopListening()
    LD->>GS: _subscription?.cancel()
    LD->>LD: _debounceTimer?.cancel()
    LD->>LD: _subscription = null, _debounceTimer = null